Program 27 – Mobile app that retrieves and displays data from a web API
To develop a simple Android app that calls a REST web API and displays the returned data 
in a list.

Code : 
[General]
sim-time-limit = 60s
repeat = 5
*.numUe = ${n = 5, 10, 20, 40}
**.ue[*].mobility.typename = "StationaryMobility"
**.ue[*].mobility.initialX = uniform(100m, 1500m)
**.ue[*].mobility.initialY = uniform(100m, 600m)
*.gnb*.cellularNic.mac.schedulingDisciplineDl = ${sched = "PF", "MAXCI", "DRR"}
*.server.numApps = ${n}
*.server.app[*].typename = "UdpBasicApp"
*.server.app[*].destAddress = "ue[" + string(ancestorIndex(0)) + "]"
*.server.app[*].messageLength = 1000B
*.server.app[*].sendInterval = 2ms
*.ue[*].numApps = 1
*.ue[*].app[0].typename = "UdpSink"
